gins to lose its power after some years. One forgets) Tj0 -10.8678  TD -0.1795  Tc -0.6431  Tw (it. When speaking to Mothe) Tj-0.8927  Tc 0  Tw (r) Tj-0.2047  Tc -0.5309  Tw (, the speech has no force or powe) Tj-0.8927  Tc 0  Tw (r) Tj-0.1723  Tc -0.6404  Tw (. Frustration develops. For) TjT* -0.0854  Tc -0.6178  Tw (several reasons, we lose it.) Tj13.7892 -16.477  TD -0.1751  Tc -0.6035  Tw (What has given the power to this method? Why has it become dry after a while, even) Tj-13.7892 -10.8678  TD -0.0534  Tc -0.6003  Tw (if it is a long while? ) Tj66.1416 0  TD /F21 9  Tf-0.048  Tc -0.6017  Tw (Its power issues out of our desire to relate to Mothe) Tj-0.7759  Tc 0  Tw (r) Tj-0.0554  Tc -0.6373  Tw (. It loses its) Tj-66.1416 -10.9846  TD 0.0207  Tc -0.2829  Tw (momentum because our attitude is one of seeking a benefit; it is mercenary) Tj275.5509 0  TD /F19 9  Tf0.0081  Tc -0.2707  Tw (. Go) Tj-275.5509 -10.8678  TD 0.0022  Tc -0.1564  Tw (beyond the method to its essence. The essence will be nebulous. Its results will be) Tj0 -10.8678  TD -0.009  Tc -0.3228  Tw (feeble. Yet continue to seek the essence. Build on it. Rest on it. Wait on it to acquire) Tj0 -10.9846  TD 0.0076  Tc -0.0725  Tw (momentum. Put your sincerity to work. Ask for nothing. Don\222t think of the results.) Tj0 -10.8678  TD -0.1046  Tc -0.5835  Tw (Concentrate on the inner essence. The essence is the real relationship with the Mothe) Tj-0.7759  Tc 0  Tw (r) Tj-0.0291  Tc (.) TjT* -0.0381  Tc -0.5625  Tw (Wait till your senses perceive it. Once you perceive it, value it for its own sake. Do not) Tj0 -10.9846  TD -0.1493  Tc -0.5978  Tw (commit the sacrilege of mixing it with mundane benefits. ) Tj189.5435 0  TD /F21 9  Tf-0.1539  Tc -0.6096  Tw (Be pure, offer sincerity. Utter) Tj-189.5435 -10.8678  TD -0.7593  Tc 0  Tw (T) Tj-0.1173  Tc -0.6044  Tw (ruthfulness is the ultimate significance. Delight in the seeking of it.) TjETBT0.9955 0 0 0.9955 243.36 164.28  Tm/